WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.038
Today is the second pair. Two letters, one sound.

2
00:00:03.488 --> 00:00:06.067
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

3
00:00:06.567 --> 00:00:09.294
Here is the pair. Two letters, and this one sound.

4
00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:14.809
Your child knows this sound. It is the long sound from day two.

5
00:00:18.941 --> 00:00:19.946
The word is rain.

6
00:00:24.526 --> 00:00:25.509
The word is nail.

7
00:00:26.409 --> 00:00:29.134
On the page, the pair has one line under it again.

8
00:00:29.584 --> 00:00:34.107
Read the first row of job one together. Your child reads the second row.

9
00:00:34.557 --> 00:00:40.263
Job two is for your child alone. Read each word first. Then draw a line to its picture.

10
00:00:40.713 --> 00:00:45.053
The picture comes after the word. So the picture is the check, and not the clue.

11
00:00:45.503 --> 00:00:48.015
At the end, your child reads three words to you.
